@prefix cepio: <https://cepio.org/ontology/core#> .
@prefix ent: <https://cepio.org/ontology/enterprise#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ent:BusinessCapability a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Entity .
ent:BusinessProcess a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Process .
ent:FinancialAccount a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Entity .
ent:CostCenter a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Entity .
ent:Supplier a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Organization .
ent:Customer a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Organization .
ent:PerformanceIndicator a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:KPI .
ent:EnterpriseRisk a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Risk .
ent:BusinessObjective a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf cepio:Objective .

ent:realizesCapability a owl:ObjectProperty .
ent:contributesToObjective a owl:ObjectProperty .
ent:incursCost a owl:ObjectProperty .
ent:exposedToRisk a owl:ObjectProperty .
ent:suppliedBy a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain cepio:Resource ; rdfs:range cepio:Organization .
